  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Democracy through engaging citizens in accountable governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence based intervention to encourage citizens to be more involved in accountable governance. The overall target group of the project are people of Sri Lanka who wish for an all-inclusive free and fair elections as well as for an accountable government. The project works towards ensuring that all Sri Lankan individuals, irrespective of the caste, class, gender have a right to vote and are empowered to do so.</narrative>
  </description>
